			"description": "<p><strong>Smart LED Temperature Display Thermos Water Bottle</strong>. Crafted from premium food-grade stainless steel, this double-wall vacuum insulated flask keeps your beverages hot or ice-cold for up to 12–24 hours. The standout feature is its intelligent HD LED touchscreen lid—simply tap the top to view the exact liquid temperature in real-time, eliminating the risk of burning your tongue on hot drinks.</p><p>Designed for active lifestyles, it features a leak-proof cap, sleek metallic finish, and a comfortable grip that fits easily into standard car cup holders and backpack side pockets. Perfect for office use, gym workouts, outdoor travel, or everyday commuting.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 my-2\"><li class=\"my-1\"><p><strong>Smart Temperature Display:</strong> Touch-sensitive LED cap shows exact liquid temperature instant.</p></li><li class=\"my-1\"><p><strong>Double-Wall Vacuum Insulation:</strong> Keeps coffee/tea piping hot or water refreshingly cold for hours.</p></li><li class=\"my-1\"><p><strong>Premium &amp; Safe Material:</strong> Made with high-quality 304 stainless steel, BPA-free, rust-resistant, and non-toxic.</p></li><li class=\"my-1\"><p><strong>Leak-Proof &amp; Durable:</strong> Tight silicon seal prevents spills, making it 100% travel-friendly.</p></li><li class=\"my-1\"><p><strong>Stylish Colors:</strong> Available in a variety of modern matte colors including Black, Blue, Pink, Red, and Silver.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
