			"name": "YAGE YG-8203L Premium Eye Protection Table Lamp – 3-Color Touch Control LED Desk Lamp with 3000mAh Battery & USB Type-C",
			"slug": "yage-yg-8203l-premium-eye-protection-table-lamp-3-color-touch-control-led-desk-lamp-with-3000mah-battery-usb-type-c",
			"brand_id": null,
			"category_id": "2d466af9-f80f-4bce-989c-39944628d0de",
			"short_description": "",
			"description": "👁️ Eye Protection Certified: Flicker-free, low-glare LED light reduces eye strain—ideal for long study hours in Bangladesh. 🎨 3 Color Temperature Modes: Warm (3000K), Natural (4500K), Cool White (6000K)—adjust with one touch. 🔘 Touch-Sensitive Control: Modern, silent operation—no mechanical switches. 🔋 3000mAh Rechargeable Battery: Up to 3.5 hours backup at max brightness; perfect for load-shedding hours. ⚡ USB Type-C Charging: Fast, universal charging—works with your phone adapter or power bank. 🔌 AC/DC Dual Power Mode: Use plugged in or wirelessly—great for dorms, hostels, and homes. 💼 Premium & Compact Design: Adjustable arm, stable base, and elegant finish—fits any Bangladeshi study table. 💡 Energy Efficient & Long Life: Saves electricity and lasts years—ideal for budget-conscious families. Welcome to ShopX, your one-stop destination for top-quality tech gadgets, home decor, accessories, and tools. Proudly rated 5 stars and recognized as one of the most trusted sellers on Daraz, we prioritize quality above all else to ensure every product exceeds your expectations.At ShopX, we believe in offering only the best for our customers. Whether you're looking to upgrade your tech gadgets, enhance your home with beautiful decor, or find reliable tools and accessories, you can count on us for a wide selection of premium products.Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our top customer ratings, with countless happy shoppers returning for our excellent service and high-quality items. We strive to provide a seamless shopping experience, from browsing to delivery, ensuring you receive only the best.Thank you for choosing ShopX—where quality meets trust!Looking for a high-quality, eye-friendly desk lamp that works even during load-shedding? Meet the YAGE YG-8203L Premium Rechargeable Table Lamp—specially designed for students, professionals, and night readers across Bangladesh who need reliable, comfortable lighting without straining their eyes.This modern LED desk lamp features advanced eye protection technology with flicker-free, soft-diffused light that reduces eye fatigue during long study sessions, online classes, or late-night reading—perfect for HSC, university, or competitive exam preparation.With 3 adjustable color temperatures—Warm White (3000K) for relaxing evenings, Natural White (4500K) for balanced focus, and Cool White (6000K) for intense concentration—you can easily match your lighting to any task using the smooth touch-control panel. No buttons, no noise—just a gentle tap to adjust brightness or switch modes.Powered by a built-in 3000mAh rechargeable battery, the YAGE YG-8203L delivers up to 3.5 hours of continuous backup at full brightness (and much longer on lower settings)—making it your go-to lamp during frequent power cuts in Dhaka, Chittagong, Sylhet, and beyond.Charging is fast and convenient via USB Type-C—compatible with your mobile charger, laptop, or power bank. Plus, enjoy dual-power flexibility: use it plugged in (AC) for all-day use, or go cordless (DC) for portability around your home or hostel.Crafted with a sleek, space-saving design and a sturdy base, this premium lamp fits perfectly on study desks, office tables, or bedside cabinets. Its energy-efficient LEDs last up to 50,000 hours, saving you money on replacements and electricity.Trusted by thousands of students and remote workers across Bangladesh, the YAGE YG-8203L combines smart features, eye safety, and uninterrupted lighting—so you never have to stop learning or working, even when the lights go out.",
