			"short_description": "",
			"description": "<p>JYSUPER JY-2096 Rechargeable LED Emergency Light – AC/DC 2400mAh</p><p>Never be caught in the dark again with the JYSUPER JY-2096 Rechargeable LED Emergency Light. Built with a powerful lithium battery and dual power modes, this emergency light is the perfect solution for load-shedding, power outages, and everyday home lighting needs across Bangladesh.</p><p>Why Choose the JYSUPER JY-2096?</p><p>🔋 High-Capacity 2400mAh Lithium Battery</p><p>Powered by a reliable 2400mAh lithium battery (2×1200mAh), this emergency light stores enough energy to keep your home lit through even the longest power cuts.</p><p>⏳ Long Backup Time – Up to 15 Hours</p><p>Choose between High and Low brightness modes depending on your needs. Get up to 4 hours of backup on High mode, or stretch it out to an impressive 15 hours on Low mode — perfect for extended outages overnight.</p><p>⚡ AC/DC Rechargeable Design</p><p>This versatile light can be recharged directly from a standard AC power outlet, giving you a fast and simple charging experience with no complicated setup.</p><p>⏱️ Quick Charging Time</p><p>With a charging time of just 3+ hours, the JY-2096 is ready to go quickly, so you're always prepared before the next power outage hits.</p><p>💡 Bright, Reliable LED Lighting</p><p>Equipped with efficient LED technology, this emergency light delivers strong, steady illumination for your living room, bedroom, kitchen, shop, or office — keeping your space bright and safe during blackouts.</p><p>Key Features at a Glance:</p><p>✅ Brand: JYSUPER</p><p>✅ Model: JY-2096</p><p>✅ Battery: 2400mAh Lithium (2×1200mAh)</p><p>✅ Power Source: AC/DC Rechargeable</p><p>✅ Backup Time: 4 Hours (High) – 15 Hours (Low)</p><p>✅ Charging Time: 3+ Hours</p><p>✅ Light Source: LED</p><p>Perfect For:</p><p>🏠 Home Power Cuts &amp; Load-Shedding</p><p>🏪 Shops &amp; Small Businesses</p><p>🏢 Offices &amp; Workspaces</p><p>🎉 Outdoor Events &amp; Gatherings</p><p>🛠️ Emergency Backup Lighting</p><p>The JYSUPER JY-2096 combines long-lasting battery life, flexible brightness modes, and dependable LED lighting in one easy-to-use package — making it a must-have for every home and business in Bangladesh.</p><p>Order now and stay prepared for the next power outage!</p><p>📦 100% Genuine Product</p><p>🚚 Fast Delivery Across Bangladesh</p><p>✅ Trusted by Thousands of Customers</p>",
