			"short_description": "",
			"description": "Efficient 6W power output for quick and reliable charging at 5V 1.2A. Smart chip technology ensures optimal and safe charging for your devices. Dual cable compatibility with both Type B and Type C for versatile use. Compatible with a wide range of devices, including TWS earbuds, neckbands, mini speakers, smartwatches, and other smart devices. Compact and portable design, perfect for travel and on-the-go charging. Durable construction for long-lasting performance and reliability. Built-in safety features protect your devices from overcharging and overheating. What sets Shop-X apart is our commitment to quality, affordability, and customer satisfaction. We believe that style should never come at the expense of your budget, and we constantly strive to offer competitive prices without compromising on excellence.6W Smart Chip Charger with Type B/Type C Cable – Ideal for TWS Earbuds, Neckbands, Mini Speakers, Smart Watches & Smart DevicesPower up your devices efficiently with this versatile 6W charger. Designed with a smart chip, it ensures safe and optimized charging for a variety of gadgets. Featuring a Type B/Type C cable, it is compatible with a wide range of smart devices, making it perfect for TWS earbuds, neckbands, mini speakers, smart watches, and other smart devices.Key Features:6W Power Output: Provides a reliable charge with 5V 1.2A output for fast, efficient power delivery.Smart Chip Technology: The built-in smart chip automatically detects your device’s charging needs, providing a safe and efficient charging experience while preventing overcharging or overheating.Universal Compatibility: Includes both Type B and Type C cables, making it ideal for charging a variety of devices, from TWS earbuds to neckband speakers, mini speakers, and smartwatches.Compact & Portable: Lightweight design that’s easy to carry on the go, making it the perfect travel companion for all your smart devices.Durable & Reliable: Made from high-quality materials for long-lasting durability and consistent performance.Whether you’re at home, at the office, or on the go, this charger is your go-to solution for quick and safe charging. Upgrade your charging experience with this 6W charger and enjoy seamless power delivery for all your devices!",
