			"description": "Brand: KINSACH Model: KS-662 Light Type: White Laser LED Power: 20W Battery Capacity: 7200mAh (Rechargeable) Charging Type: Type-C Fast Charging Additional Feature: Powerbank Function Body Material: Aluminium Alloy Lighting Range: Long Distance Waterproof: Yes Runtime: Up to 10–12 Hours (Approx.) Function: Zoomable Focus Suitable For: Camping, Hiking, Patrol, Emergency, Repairs Welcome to ShopX, your one-stop destination for top-quality tech gadgets, home decor, accessories, and tools. Proudly rated 5 stars and recognized as one of the most trusted sellers on Daraz, we prioritize quality above all else to ensure every product exceeds your expectations.At ShopX, we believe in offering only the best for our customers. Whether you're looking to upgrade your tech gadgets, enhance your home with beautiful decor, or find reliable tools and accessories, you can count on us for a wide selection of premium products.Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our top customer ratings, with countless happy shoppers returning for our excellent service and high-quality items. We strive to provide a seamless shopping experience, from browsing to delivery, ensuring you receive only the best.Thank you for choosing ShopX—where quality meets trust!Key HighlightsUltra-bright 20W White Laser LED for long-range visibility and superior illuminationHeavy-duty aluminium alloy body – durable, rustproof, and built for rough outdoor useLarge 7200mAh rechargeable battery for extended standby and up to 10–12 hours of lightType-C fast charging system with powerbank function to charge phones or gadgetsWaterproof design ensures reliable performance in rain or humid environmentsAdjustable zoom for focused beam or wide-area lightingPerfect for camping, trekking, patrol duty, emergency repairs, and night securityProduct DescriptionThe KINSACH KS-662 Long Range Flashlight is a professional-grade torch built for high brightness and endurance. With its 20W White Laser LED, this flashlight delivers powerful, focused illumination that reaches impressive distances—ideal for outdoor adventures, emergency tasks, or professional use.Powered by a 7200mAh high-capacity battery, it offers long standby time and reliable light for up to 10–12 hours on a single charge. Its built-in Type-C charging port supports fast recharge and doubles as a powerbank, letting you charge your phone or small devices when needed.Crafted from aerospace-grade aluminium alloy, the KS-662 is both lightweight and durable, resistant to drops and harsh weather. The waterproof design means you can depend on it even in rain or wet conditions. The zoomable head lets you switch easily between a wide floodlight and a sharp, focused beam for distance viewing.Whether you’re out camping, trekking, on night patrol, or facing an unexpected power cut, the KINSACH KS-662 Flashlight gives you unmatched brightness, longevity, and peace of mind.",
