			"sku": "",
			"name": "PL Supreme PL-39 High Power Rechargeable Flashlight – 1500mAh Metal Body Torch with Side LED",
			"slug": "pl-supreme-pl-39-high-power-rechargeable-flashlight-1500mah-metal-body-torch-with-side-led",
			"brand_id": null,
			"category_id": "10198038-73a5-4e5b-9150-13466583e8b6",
			"short_description": "",
			"description": "<p>Meet the PL Supreme PL-39, a compact yet powerful rechargeable flashlight designed for everyday reliability. Featuring a bright white laser-style LED beam and a handy side LED light, this flashlight is built to handle everything from power outages to outdoor adventures, giving you dependable illumination whenever you need it.</p><p>Why Choose the PL Supreme PL-39?</p><p>⚡ Reliable 1500mAh Rechargeable Battery</p><p>Powered by a built-in 1500mAh rechargeable battery, the PL-39 offers steady performance for daily use without the hassle or cost of disposable batteries. Simply charge it up and you're ready to go.</p><p>💡 Bright White Laser LED</p><p>The main LED delivers a sharp, focused white laser-style beam, cutting through darkness with ease — ideal for night walks, load-shedding, camping, and emergency situations.</p><p>🔦 Convenient Side LED Light</p><p>In addition to the primary beam, the PL-39 comes with a built-in side LED, giving you a secondary light source for close-range tasks like reading, repairs, or lighting up a room — no need to carry a second torch.</p><p>💪 Sturdy Metal Body</p><p>Built with a solid metal housing, the PL-39 is designed for durability and long-term daily use, resisting wear and handling everyday knocks and drops with ease.</p><p>Key Features at a Glance:</p><p>✅ Brand: PL Supreme</p><p>✅ Model: PL-39</p><p>✅ Battery Capacity: 1500mAh (Rechargeable)</p><p>✅ LED Type: White Laser LED + Side LED</p><p>✅ Body Material: Durable Metal</p><p>✅ Design: Compact &amp; Portable</p><p>Perfect For:</p><p>🏠 Home Emergency Lighting &amp; Power Cuts</p><p>🚶 Night Walks &amp; Daily Commuting</p><p>🏕️ Camping &amp; Outdoor Trips</p><p>🔧 Quick Repairs &amp; Close-Range Tasks</p><p>🎒 Everyday Carry (EDC)</p><p>The PL Supreme PL-39 combines a powerful main beam with the added convenience of a side light, making it a versatile, all-in-one lighting solution for your home, work, and outdoor needs.</p><p>Order now and light up your everyday moments with the PL Supreme PL-39!</p><p>📦 100% Genuine Product</p><p>🚚 Fast Delivery Across Bangladesh</p><p>✅ Trusted by Thousands of Customers</p><p></p><p></p>",
