			"short_description": "",
			"description": "Model: PL-027 Light Source: LED (Main) + COB (Side) Battery: Built-in 1200mAh rechargeable lithium battery Charging: Type-C USB port (cable included) Run Time: Up to 4 hours per charge Material: Aluminum alloy metal body Light Modes: High, Low, COB, Strobe Zoom: Adjustable focus Additional Feature: Pocket/Belt Clip Color: Black / Silver (subject to availability) Welcome to ShopX, your one-stop destination for top-quality tech gadgets, home decor, accessories, and tools. Proudly rated 5 stars and recognized as one of the most trusted sellers on Daraz, we prioritize quality above all else to ensure every product exceeds your expectations.At ShopX, we believe in offering only the best for our customers. Whether you're looking to upgrade your tech gadgets, enhance your home with beautiful decor, or find reliable tools and accessories, you can count on us for a wide selection of premium products.Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our top customer ratings, with countless happy shoppers returning for our excellent service and high-quality items. We strive to provide a seamless shopping experience, from browsing to delivery, ensuring you receive only the best.Thank you for choosing ShopX—where quality meets trust! Short Description (Bullet Points):✅ Model: PL-027 – Multifunction LED Torch Light with Zoom Feature💡 Dual Light Source: Powerful LED + COB side light for versatile brightness🔋 Rechargeable 1200mAh Battery – Long-lasting use up to 4 hours⚡ Fast Type-C Charging Port – Quick & convenient charging🔦 Zoom Function – Adjustable focus for wide and narrow beams📎 Convenient Clip – Easily attach to pockets, belts, or bags for portability🏕️ Ideal For: Camping, Emergency, Outdoor Activities, Power Outages, and More🛠️ Sturdy Metal Body – Lightweight aluminum alloy for durabilityFull Product Description:Multifunction Zoom Torch Light PL-027 – Compact, Powerful, and Ready for Any TaskIntroducing the PL-027 Multifunction Zoom Torch Light, a versatile rechargeable flashlight designed to illuminate your path with precision and power. Perfect for outdoor adventures, emergencies, or everyday use, this torch combines powerful LED illumination with a practical design.🔦 Dual Lighting Modes: Switch effortlessly between a bright, focused LED spotlight for long-distance vision and a broad COB side light for area illumination. This dual setup makes the PL-027 ideal for any situation where reliable light is needed.🔄 Adjustable Zoom: Customize your beam from a wide floodlight to a sharp spotlight with the easy-to-use zoom feature, giving you control over your lighting needs.🔋 Rechargeable 1200mAh Battery: Enjoy up to 4 hours of continuous light on a full charge. Recharge quickly with the modern Type-C USB charging port, compatible with most chargers and power banks.📎 Practical Clip Design: Easily clip the torch onto your belt, backpack, or pocket for hands-free carrying and quick access. No need to worry about losing it during your activities.💪 Durable Metal Body: Crafted from sturdy aluminum alloy, the torch is lightweight yet tough enough to withstand everyday use and rough outdoor conditions.Specifications:Model: PL-027Light Source: LED (Main) + COB (Side)Battery: Built-in 1200mAh rechargeable lithium batteryCharging: Type-C USB port (cable included)Run Time: Up to 4 hours per chargeMaterial: Aluminum alloy metal bodyLight Modes: High, Low, COB, StrobeZoom: Adjustable focusAdditional Feature: Pocket/Belt ClipColor: Black / Silver (subject to availability)Why Choose the PL-027 Multifunction Torch Light?✅ Compact & Portable with Clip for Easy Carry ✅ Powerful & Efficient LED + COB Lighting ✅ Rechargeable & Environmentally Friendly ✅ Perfect for Outdoor, Emergency, and Everyday Use ✅ Rugged Design Built to LastSEO Keywords: Multifunction Torch Light, PL-027 Flashlight, Rechargeable LED Torch, COB Side Light Flashlight, Type-C Charging Torch, 1200mAh Battery Torch, Zoom Flashlight with Clip, Outdoor Torch Light, Emergency L",
