			"short_description": "",
			"description": "🔊 Powerful Heavy Bass Sound – Deep, punchy bass and clear audio for music, movies, and calls 📶 Bluetooth 5.3 – Latest wireless tech for fast, stable pairing with lower power use 🔋 Rechargeable Battery – Up to 2–4 hours of playtime depending on volume 💡 RGB LED Lights – Dynamic, colorful lighting that syncs with your music 📻 Built-in FM Radio – Auto-scan feature to enjoy your favorite radio stations anytime 🎶 Multi-Playback Support – Play via TF card, USB flash drive, AUX, or Bluetooth 📞 Hands-Free Calling – Built-in mic lets you answer calls directly from the speaker 👜 Portable & Stylish Boombox Design – Lightweight, compact, and easy to carry 🔧 Easy Controls – Intuitive buttons for mode switching, volume, play/pause, and more 🎁 Perfect for Parties, Travel, Outdoor & Indoor Use Welcome to ShopX, your one-stop destination for top-quality tech gadgets, home decor, accessories, and tools. Proudly rated 5 stars and recognized as one of the most trusted sellers on Daraz, we prioritize quality above all else to ensure every product exceeds your expectations.At ShopX, we believe in offering only the best for our customers. Whether you're looking to upgrade your tech gadgets, enhance your home with beautiful decor, or find reliable tools and accessories, you can count on us for a wide selection of premium products.Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our top customer ratings, with countless happy shoppers returning for our excellent service and high-quality items. We strive to provide a seamless shopping experience, from browsing to delivery, ensuring you receive only the best.Thank you for choosing ShopX—where quality meets trust! 🔊 Heavy Bass MS-70 Portable Wireless Bluetooth Speaker | Boombox | RGB Lights | BT 5.3 | FM Radio | USB | TF Card | CallingElevate your audio experience with the Heavy Bass MS-70 Portable Wireless Bluetooth Speaker, designed for bold sound and versatile playback. With upgraded Bluetooth 5.3, stunning RGB lights, and support for FM Radio, TF Card, USB, and Hands-Free Calling, the MS-70 is your go-to portable speaker for every occasion.✅ Key Features:🔊 Heavy Bass OutputRich, booming bass and clear highsDesigned for music lovers, partygoers, and outdoor fun📶 Latest Bluetooth 5.3 TechnologyFaster, more stable connectionExtended range and lower power consumptionWorks with all Bluetooth-enabled devices (smartphones, tablets, laptops)💡 RGB LED Party LightsColor-changing RGB lighting that reacts to your musicAdds energy and fun to any setting🔋 Rechargeable Battery – 2 to 4 Hours PlaytimePlay music continuously for 2–4 hours depending on volume and usageRecharge easily with the included USB cable📻 Built-in FM Radio TunerListen to local radio stations on the goAuto-scan function with saved station memory🎶 Multi-Mode Music PlaybackTF Card Slot – Load your music directly from a memory cardUSB Port – Plug in a flash drive with your favorite tracksAUX Input – 3.5mm jack for wired audio sources📞 Hands-Free Calling with Built-in MicrophoneAnswer calls directly from the speakerNoise-reducing mic for clear voice quality👜 Portable Boombox DesignLightweight and compact with a carry handleRugged build, stylish look, perfect for both indoor and outdoor use📦 What’s in the Box?1 × MS-70 Wireless Bluetooth Speaker1 × USB Charging Cable1 × User Manual🎯 Great For:Backyard partiesBeach and travelBedroom or personal workspaceGifts for teens, students, and music fans💡 Why Choose the Heavy Bass MS-70?Combining Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity, booming bass, and multiple playback options in a portable and stylish form, the MS-70 delivers value, performance, and personality in one compact speaker. Whether you're streaming music, playing off a USB, or tuning into FM radio, this speaker has everything you need.📈 Optimized Keywords for Search Visibility:Bluetooth 5.3 wireless speakerPortable heavy bass speakerRGB Bluetooth boombox speakerMS-70 speaker with FM, USB, TF cardHands-free speaker with micRecharge",
