			"description": "Color will be chosen RANDOMLY Supported Storage : 16GB-256GB • Multifunctional 6 in 1 card reader. • Supports USB 2.0 and OTG plug and play. • Compatible with SD/TF Card/Type C/microUSB/USB. • High-speed data transfer with 480mbps write speed. • Available in black and white color options. • Ideal for computers and laptops. • Compact and easy to carry. • Versatile connectivity options with USB/Type C/microUSB. • Perfect for transferring data between devices. • Enhance your productivity with this card reader.What sets Shop-X apart is our commitment to quality, affordability, and customer satisfaction. We believe that style should never come at the expense of your budget, and we constantly strive to offer competitive prices without compromising on excellence.This Multifunction OTG Card Reader is a versatile 6 in 1 card reader that supports USB 2.0 and plug-and-play OTG connectivity. It is compatible with SD/TF cards, Type C, microUSB, and USB devices, making it a convenient all-in-one solution for transferring data between devices. With a write speed of 480mbps, this card reader is perfect for quickly transferring large files such as photos and videos. Its compact design and black and white color options make it a stylish and practical addition to any computer setup. Whether you're a professional photographer or just need a reliable way to transfer files, this card reader is the perfect choice.In this video, we take a closer look at the 6 in 1 OTG Card Reader, a must-have accessory for anyone who frequently transfers files between multiple devices. Whether you're using a smartphone, tablet, or PC, this versatile card reader supports multiple card types and lets you connect various storage devices seamlessly. Perfect for photographers, content creators, and tech enthusiasts, the 6 in 1 OTG Card Reader simplifies file management and enhances your device's functionality.🔌 Features:Multiple Compatibility: Supports SD, microSD, TF, and other card formats.OTG Functionality: Directly connects to your mobile phone or tablet without the need for a computer.Fast Transfer: Enjoy quick file transfers between devices without hassle.Portable Design: Compact and lightweight, making it perfect for on-the-go use.📱 How It Works: This card reader is fully compatible with Android devices that support USB OTG. Simply plug it into your phone or tablet and start transferring files from your memory cards or USB drives.Pros:Fast and efficient file transferNo need for a computerSupports various card typesEasy to use and setupCompact and travel-friendly",
