			"description": "3W LED Zoomable Bulb: High-intensity lighting with adjustable focus Rechargeable 1200mAh Battery: Long-lasting power for extended use Water-resistant Design: Safe to use in all weather conditions Adjustable Strap: Comfortable and secure fit Compact and Lightweight: Easy to carry, ideal for outdoor adventures Perfect for: Hiking, camping, fishing, cycling, night runs, and emergency situations Welcome to ShopX, your one-stop destination for top-quality tech gadgets, home decor, accessories, and tools. Proudly rated 5 stars and recognized as one of the most trusted sellers on Daraz, we prioritize quality above all else to ensure every product exceeds your expectations.At ShopX, we believe in offering only the best for our customers. Whether you're looking to upgrade your tech gadgets, enhance your home with beautiful decor, or find reliable tools and accessories, you can count on us for a wide selection of premium products.Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our top customer ratings, with countless happy shoppers returning for our excellent service and high-quality items. We strive to provide a seamless shopping experience, from browsing to delivery, ensuring you receive only the best.Thank you for choosing ShopX—where quality meets trust!Product Title: PLSUPREME PL-56 Powerful 3W LED Zoom Head Lamp Light Rechargeable Torch 1200mAhProduct Description:Light up your path with the PLSUPREME PL-56 Powerful 3W LED Zoom Head Lamp Light Rechargeable Torch 1200mAh. Perfect for outdoor enthusiasts, adventurers, and anyone in need of reliable lighting, this headlamp offers powerful illumination and maximum comfort. Equipped with a 3W LED bulb, this headlamp ensures a bright, focused beam for all your nighttime activities, whether you're camping, hiking, fishing, or working in low-light conditions.The PLSUPREME PL-56 features an innovative zoomable design, allowing you to adjust the beam’s focus for both wide-area lighting and long-distance visibility. Its rechargeable 1200mAh battery ensures long-lasting power, keeping you illuminated for hours on end.Built for durability, this headlamp light is lightweight and designed to comfortably fit your head, with an adjustable strap for a secure, custom fit. The water-resistant body means you can rely on it even in adverse weather conditions.Key Features:3W LED Zoomable Bulb: High-intensity lighting with adjustable focusRechargeable 1200mAh Battery: Long-lasting power for extended useWater-resistant Design: Safe to use in all weather conditionsAdjustable Strap: Comfortable and secure fitCompact and Lightweight: Easy to carry, ideal for outdoor adventuresPerfect for: Hiking, camping, fishing, cycling, night runs, and emergency situationsWhy Choose PLSUPREME PL-56?Superior brightness with adjustable zoomHigh-quality rechargeable battery for cost savingsEco-friendly, reduces the need for disposable batteriesDurable and long-lasting, built to withstand tough conditionsWhether you're exploring the great outdoors or need reliable lighting for DIY tasks, the PLSUPREME PL-56 is the perfect companion. Don't miss out on this affordable, yet high-performance, LED headlamp light—buy it now and brighten your way!SEO Tags:PLSUPREME PL-56 HeadlampRechargeable LED Torch3W LED Head LampZoomable LED HeadlampWaterproof LED HeadlampOutdoor Rechargeable Headlamp1200mAh LED TorchLED Headlight for CampingPowerful LED Torch LightBest Rechargeable TorchDurable Outdoor HeadlampLED Zoom Head Lamp for HikingHigh Power LED TorchLED Rechargeable Headlamp LightPortable Rechargeable Torch LightCamping LED Zoom Headlamp",
